 "summary": "A three-pole female XLR receptacle in a round plastic body, mounted from behind a front panel and soldered horizontally to a PCB. Pin 1 is joined straight to the front panel and to the shell of the mating plug; there is no separate ground contact. Receptacles can sit on 23 mm centres. Each contact carries 6 A at under 50 V, over -30 °C to +80 °C.",
